<title>UK: Granada firms on NatWest upgrade.</title>
<headline>Granada firms on NatWest upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Granada Group Plc rose to a four-week high on Wednesday after brokerage NatWest upgraded the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0821 GMT, Granada shares were up 21p to 822.  </p>
<p>Dealers said NatWest raised its recommendation on Granada to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;add.&quot;</p>
<p>The analyst at NatWest couldn't immediately be reached to comment. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
